error[E0320]: a region value escapes its scope: the region `r` would occur in the result `RIO r (Arena r)`
 --> tests/achc/typeck/fail/region_escape.hs:9:31
  |
9 | leakArena = withRegion (\a -> pureR a)
  |                               ^^^^^^^
  = note: the arena, its handles (`In`/`RefIn`) and computations using them (`RIO`) cannot leave the `withRegion` that created them: the region is freed when it ends
  = help: return a value read from the region instead (e.g. with `readIn`)
